---
const features = [
  {
    title: "One catalog across agents",
    body: "Discover the models available to your Cursor account once, then use the same catalog from each connected local agent."
  },
  {
    title: "OpenCode, fully integrated",
    body: "Cursor's exact thinking, reasoning, effort, context, and fast presets appear as native variants directly in OpenCode's model picker."
  },
  {
    title: "Your stack, discovered",
    body: "Model Ferry scans PATH and known config homes for more than 40 agent harnesses, then shows what it found and what it can configure."
  },
  {
    title: "A standard way in",
    body: "Pi and Hermes configure automatically. Other same-machine clients can use the local OpenAI Chat Completions URL and token when they support custom providers."
  },
  {
    title: "Local by default",
    body: "The bridge binds to 127.0.0.1 and protects every route with a unique install token. Nothing else on your network can reach it."
  },
  {
    title: "Your agent owns tools",
    body: "Function tools return to the originating client for execution. Shell, edit, and other Cursor built-ins stay off."
  }
];
---
<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="kicker">Features</span>
    <h2 class="heading">Switch agents, not model access.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Model Ferry separates the Cursor models available to you from the local agent interface you choose to use.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      {features.map((feature) => (
        <div class="card">
          <h3>{feature.title}</h3>
          <p>{feature.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .heading { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px); max-width: 620px; }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; margin: 12px 0 40px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); }
  .card h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
